 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In Sunmere, it has been noon for four hundred years.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "The sun never moves. At bedtime, everyone pulls on a sleep mask.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody goes near the Rim, the white wall around the city.",
   "tag": "[ominous]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Pia noticed things. Balloons always popped at the same height.",
   "tag": "[curious]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Grandpa never took off his brass key stamped HELM.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "“Old junk. It opens nothing.”",
   "tag": "[gruff, dismissive]",
   "pause": 0.14,
   "voice": "grandpa",
   "speak": "Old junk. It opens nothing."
  },
  {
   "text": "One bedtime, she slipped it off his neck while he snored.",
   "tag": "[hushed]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "At the Rim, behind a hedge, was a round door marked crew only.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "A guard stood there. She threw her alarm clock into the bushes and turned the key.",
   "tag": "[urgent]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "No sea of fire. Just black sky and a billion stars.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Sunmere wasn't a city. It was a ship. The sun was a lamp.",
   "tag": "[stunned]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "“Let her go, Tomas.”",
   "tag": "[calm, firm]",
   "pause": 0.14,
   "voice": "grandpa",
   "speak": "Let her go, Tomas."
  },
  {
   "text": "“Our world was dying. This ship carries us to a new one.”",
   "tag": "[gentle]",
   "pause": 0.12,
   "voice": "grandpa",
   "speak": "Our world was dying. This ship carries us to a new one."
  },
  {
   "text": "Far ahead, a small green planet was growing.",
   "tag": "[wonder]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "“We steer it. You'd have had the key tomorrow.”",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.12,
   "voice": "grandpa",
   "speak": "We steer it. You'd have had the key tomorrow."
  },
  {
   "text": "“Why tomorrow?”",
   "tag": "[curious]",
   "pause": 0.12,
   "voice": "pia",
   "speak": "Why tomorrow?"
  },
  {
   "text": "“Because tomorrow, we land.”",
   "tag": "[smiling]",
   "pause": 0.14,
   "voice": "grandpa",
   "speak": "Because tomorrow, we land."
  },
  {
   "text": "Tomorrow, someone switches off the sun for the first time in four hundred years.",
   "tag": "[warm, hopeful]",
   "pause": 0.12
  }
 ],
